1
00:01:21,599 --> 00:01:22,120
Shen Leshui.

2
00:01:22,480 --> 00:01:23,599
When are you giving me that money?

3
00:01:27,000 --> 00:01:27,480
Soon.

4
00:01:27,959 --> 00:01:29,159
I'm going back home tomorrow to sell the house.

5
00:01:29,439 --> 00:01:30,400
Are you coming back to Beijing then?

6
00:01:30,560 --> 00:01:31,280
No, I'm not.

7
00:01:44,480 --> 00:01:45,719
Shen Leshui,

8
00:01:47,680 --> 00:01:48,879
wishing you a

9
00:01:49,680 --> 00:01:51,079
happy birthday.

10
00:03:53,159 --> 00:03:53,639
Right.

11
00:03:54,400 --> 00:03:55,240
As long as it's cash.

12
00:03:57,400 --> 00:03:58,280
Get your candied haws!

13
00:03:59,719 --> 00:04:00,599
I can go a bit lower.

14
00:04:00,680 --> 00:04:01,280
Candied haws!

15
00:04:01,280 --> 00:04:02,039
I need the cash urgently.

16
00:04:02,879 --> 00:04:03,719
Be careful.

17
00:04:05,360 --> 00:04:05,759
Okay.

18
00:04:06,240 --> 00:04:07,159
Freshly popped popcorn!

19
00:04:07,520 --> 00:04:08,919
Isn't that Shen Leshui?

20
00:04:09,000 --> 00:04:10,479
Haven't seen her in so many years.

21
00:04:11,000 --> 00:04:11,319
Good grief.

22
00:04:11,319 --> 00:04:13,039
Wasn't she doing quite well in Beijing?

23
00:04:13,280 --> 00:04:14,240
Why is she back?

24
00:04:14,240 --> 00:04:15,319
Look at her, all dressed up.

25
00:04:24,639 --> 00:04:25,360
Under its influence,

26
00:04:25,360 --> 00:04:25,920
over the next three days,

27
00:04:25,920 --> 00:04:27,120
most parts of northern China

28
00:04:27,120 --> 00:04:28,680
will experience strong winds and dropping temperatures.

29
00:04:29,040 --> 00:04:29,839
Meanwhile, under the combined influence of cold air

30
00:04:29,839 --> 00:04:31,199
and warm, moist air currents,

31
00:04:31,360 --> 00:04:32,120
over the next three days,

32
00:04:32,120 --> 00:04:34,319
the south will still see significant precipitation.

33
00:04:34,680 --> 00:04:35,759
Please clean up

34
00:04:35,920 --> 00:04:37,240
Unit 1, Building 18,

35
00:04:37,800 --> 00:04:39,040
the garbage outside Room 302,

36
00:04:40,000 --> 00:04:41,800
and remind them not to pile it up.

37
00:05:25,120 --> 00:05:26,240
It's already this low,

38
00:05:26,360 --> 00:05:27,480
and he's still haggling?

39
00:05:28,000 --> 00:05:29,439
I really need the money,

40
00:05:30,079 --> 00:05:31,800
or I wouldn't have come all the way back.

41
00:05:32,920 --> 00:05:33,680
Just hold out for now.

42
00:05:34,319 --> 00:05:35,360
If you really can't hold out, we'll talk.

43
00:05:44,160 --> 00:05:45,319
Star reporter, star director!

44
00:05:45,600 --> 00:05:46,079
Holy smokes!

45
00:05:46,079 --> 00:05:47,000
What a coincidence, Ma Guowen!

46
00:05:47,319 --> 00:05:48,199
Director Ma.

47
00:05:49,040 --> 00:05:50,079
Long time no see!

48
00:05:50,639 --> 00:05:52,279
You haven't changed a bit!

49
00:05:52,519 --> 00:05:53,879
Look at me, I've gotten so old.

50
00:05:54,920 --> 00:05:55,600
Director Ma.

51
00:05:56,160 --> 00:05:56,959
Long time no see.

52
00:05:57,240 --> 00:05:58,959
I was just saying I want to make a promo video,

53
00:05:58,959 --> 00:06:00,240
and boom, I run right into you!

54
00:06:00,279 --> 00:06:01,480
What a coincidence!

55
00:06:01,680 --> 00:06:02,639
A busy person like you,

56
00:06:02,839 --> 00:06:04,439
what brings you back to Lacheng?

57
00:06:04,600 --> 00:06:05,759
Just visiting my mom,

58
00:06:06,319 --> 00:06:07,680
and sorting out the house.

59
00:06:09,759 --> 00:06:11,000
What happened to your hand?

60
00:06:11,199 --> 00:06:12,079
Cut it on some glass.

61
00:06:12,480 --> 00:06:13,040
Getting some medicine.

62
00:06:13,439 --> 00:06:13,839
It's nothing.

63
00:06:14,680 --> 00:06:15,439
Hop in, then.

64
00:06:15,560 --> 00:06:16,639
I'll give you a lift to get medicine.

65
00:06:16,639 --> 00:06:17,199
No, really, don't bother.

66
00:06:17,199 --> 00:06:18,040
I'd rather walk.

67
00:06:19,000 --> 00:06:19,800
Don't go!

68
00:06:20,319 --> 00:06:21,959
Didn't I say I had serious business?

69
00:06:22,279 --> 00:06:24,120
This time, I want to invest good money

70
00:06:24,160 --> 00:06:24,959
and make a real blockbuster.

71
00:06:28,399 --> 00:06:30,160
How's business at the factory?

72
00:06:30,439 --> 00:06:32,439
A blockbuster costs a lot of money.

73
00:06:33,439 --> 00:06:34,879
Precisely because business isn't good,

74
00:06:34,879 --> 00:06:36,480
we need to promote it with a video!

75
00:06:36,720 --> 00:06:38,199
In the past, good wine

76
00:06:38,560 --> 00:06:39,319
needed no bush.

77
00:06:39,480 --> 00:06:41,360
Now, even good wine gets overlooked!

78
00:06:41,360 --> 00:06:42,399
So we have to advertise!

79
00:06:42,560 --> 00:06:43,519
The worse it gets, the more we need promo.

80
00:06:44,439 --> 00:06:44,879
How about this?

81
00:06:44,959 --> 00:06:45,680
Let's talk on the way.

82
00:06:45,720 --> 00:06:46,319
I'll tell you all about it.

83
00:06:46,560 --> 00:06:46,959
Come on, get in.

84
00:06:46,959 --> 00:06:47,560
Hop in, hop in.

85
00:06:49,199 --> 00:06:49,680
Thank you.

86
00:06:49,800 --> 00:06:51,199
Man, what a crazy coincidence!

87
00:06:51,199 --> 00:06:51,680
See,

88
00:06:54,879 --> 00:06:55,600
Xiao Rui,

89
00:06:56,240 --> 00:06:57,240
Director Shen here...

90
00:06:57,240 --> 00:06:59,079
...is a big-shot director from Beijing!

91
00:06:59,160 --> 00:07:00,439
She directed our The Malt Kingdom!

92
00:07:00,439 --> 00:07:01,560
She even won big awards!

93
00:07:02,000 --> 00:07:04,160
When do you plan to shoot this blockbuster?

94
00:07:04,240 --> 00:07:05,160
I'm back this time,

95
00:07:05,160 --> 00:07:06,120
but can only stay a few days.

96
00:07:06,680 --> 00:07:07,480
You're in a hurry?

97
00:07:07,759 --> 00:07:09,040
I'm actually in more of a rush than you!

98
00:07:09,240 --> 00:07:10,439
We'll get right on it.

99
00:07:10,519 --> 00:07:11,439
How much

100
00:07:12,399 --> 00:07:13,279
are you planning to spend

101
00:07:13,399 --> 00:07:14,079
on this film?

102
00:07:15,240 --> 00:07:16,879
Well, you're the expert.

103
00:07:16,920 --> 00:07:17,920
I should be asking you!

104
00:07:17,920 --> 00:07:18,480
Give me...

105
00:07:18,720 --> 00:07:19,800
...give us a ballpark figure.

106
00:07:19,959 --> 00:07:20,720
Give me an honest quote,

107
00:07:21,040 --> 00:07:21,439
all right?

108
00:07:22,639 --> 00:07:23,199
300,000.

109
00:07:23,199 --> 00:07:24,120
Does that work for you?

110
00:07:25,120 --> 00:07:26,240
The factory is about to be sold.

111
00:07:26,439 --> 00:07:27,680
Where would we get that kind of money?

112
00:07:27,879 --> 00:07:28,360
Sell?

113
00:07:28,959 --> 00:07:29,879
Selling the factory again?

114
00:07:30,480 --> 00:07:31,560
Look at me now.

115
00:07:32,040 --> 00:07:33,399
My hair has gone completely gray.

116
00:07:33,399 --> 00:07:35,240
My old body is falling apart.

117
00:07:35,600 --> 00:07:36,959
I just can't keep going.

118
00:07:37,560 --> 00:07:38,279
Selling the factory...

119
00:07:38,959 --> 00:07:39,720
making a film...

120
00:07:40,399 --> 00:07:41,560
Over ten years...

121
00:07:42,560 --> 00:07:43,160
Fine, all right.

122
00:07:43,560 --> 00:07:44,639
Never thought... Let's do 300,000.

123
00:07:44,639 --> 00:07:45,560
...I'd end up back here.

124
00:07:45,560 --> 00:07:46,879
Make it a good one for me, Director Shen.

125
00:07:48,560 --> 00:07:49,279
What's the matter?

126
00:07:50,000 --> 00:07:51,160
Don't be upset.

127
00:07:51,560 --> 00:07:52,199
If you...

128
00:07:52,639 --> 00:07:53,040
...well...

129
00:07:53,439 --> 00:07:54,160
...if you're worried,

130
00:07:54,480 --> 00:07:56,279
take this 30,000 deposit first.

131
00:08:01,879 --> 00:08:02,480
Good grief.

132
00:08:02,879 --> 00:08:03,360
You... you...

133
00:08:03,519 --> 00:08:04,120
Are you sure...

134
00:08:04,120 --> 00:08:05,800
...you really don't want a ride home?

135
00:08:05,879 --> 00:08:06,519
No need, really.

136
00:08:06,519 --> 00:08:07,079
This is fine.

137
00:08:07,560 --> 00:08:08,800
Then we have a deal!

138
00:08:08,800 --> 00:08:09,439
First thing tomorrow morning,

139
00:08:09,439 --> 00:08:10,319
I'll wait for you at the factory.

140
00:08:10,399 --> 00:08:11,040
See you there!

141
00:08:24,600 --> 00:08:25,480
Hey, Xiao Liu.

142
00:08:27,720 --> 00:08:28,680
Another few days?

143
00:08:29,839 --> 00:08:30,879
I really need the money.

144
00:08:31,120 --> 00:08:32,159
Could you push him again?

145
00:08:32,879 --> 00:08:33,360
All right.

146
00:08:33,639 --> 00:08:34,120
Thanks.

147
00:08:42,919 --> 00:08:43,480
Haipeng!

148
00:08:44,080 --> 00:08:44,720
It's me.

149
00:08:46,480 --> 00:08:47,159
You made it.

150
00:08:49,039 --> 00:08:50,240
Look at you!

151
00:08:51,639 --> 00:08:52,759
Just got back to Lacheng,

152
00:08:52,759 --> 00:08:54,279
and you already landed such a sweet gig.

153
00:08:56,440 --> 00:08:57,919
That's our Shen Leshui for you.

154
00:08:59,240 --> 00:08:59,840
Let's sit down and talk.

155
00:09:01,879 --> 00:09:04,120
Looks like Ma Guowen's eager to sell the plant.

156
00:09:05,159 --> 00:09:06,039
Just watch your back.

157
00:09:06,720 --> 00:09:07,720
I'm worried he might stiff you.

158
00:09:09,559 --> 00:09:10,799
You know him better than I do.

159
00:09:11,039 --> 00:09:12,480
Everyone knows what kind of guy he is.

160
00:09:12,759 --> 00:09:13,159
No, no.

161
00:09:13,559 --> 00:09:14,120
Not here.

162
00:09:15,039 --> 00:09:16,159
I just remodeled the shop.

163
00:09:16,159 --> 00:09:17,080
Take a look around.

164
00:09:18,639 --> 00:09:19,200
Listen to me,

165
00:09:19,399 --> 00:09:20,159
the most important thing is

166
00:09:20,399 --> 00:09:22,360
to make this quick buck as fast as possible.

167
00:09:22,559 --> 00:09:23,039
That's true.

168
00:09:24,919 --> 00:09:25,919
If I didn't need the money so badly,

169
00:09:26,120 --> 00:09:27,039
I wouldn't have taken this job.

170
00:09:27,039 --> 00:09:29,000
I've got the crew and gear all ready for you.

171
00:09:29,399 --> 00:09:30,919
But when you start shooting tomorrow,

172
00:09:30,919 --> 00:09:31,799
I won't be able to join you.

173
00:09:32,559 --> 00:09:34,399
Lili has a prenatal checkup first thing tomorrow.

174
00:09:36,639 --> 00:09:37,679
You're gonna be a dad?

175
00:09:38,720 --> 00:09:39,399
Congratulations!

176
00:09:41,159 --> 00:09:42,360
Your shop looks great too.

177
00:09:43,559 --> 00:09:44,759
Business seems to be booming.

178
00:09:45,240 --> 00:09:45,799
Pretty good.

179
00:09:46,000 --> 00:09:47,120
Just hustling along.

180
00:09:47,320 --> 00:09:48,080
Depends on who you compare it to.

181
00:09:48,399 --> 00:09:49,840
Compared to you, I've got a long way to go.

182
00:09:50,519 --> 00:09:51,679
Come on, let's sit and chat over here.

183
00:09:52,559 --> 00:09:53,039
Where's the tea?

184
00:09:55,759 --> 00:09:56,279
How about you?

185
00:09:57,320 --> 00:09:58,080
Seeing anyone yet?

186
00:09:59,600 --> 00:10:00,200
Here's your tea, Boss.

187
00:10:01,000 --> 00:10:01,799
I've got plenty of suitors.

188
00:10:02,000 --> 00:10:02,720
No need for you to worry.

189
00:10:03,759 --> 00:10:04,440
Do you have a drone?

190
00:10:04,919 --> 00:10:05,399
Yeah, I do.

191
00:10:06,519 --> 00:10:07,080
Besides that,

192
00:10:07,399 --> 00:10:08,639
two professional cameras,

193
00:10:08,759 --> 00:10:09,559
one sound recorder.

194
00:10:09,759 --> 00:10:10,759
I'll find the line producer.

195
00:10:14,840 --> 00:10:16,600
I'll notify the drone crew right now.

196
00:10:16,919 --> 00:10:17,360
By the way,

197
00:10:17,879 --> 00:10:18,840
you don't have to pay them.

198
00:10:21,240 --> 00:10:22,559
I'll cover their wages.

199
00:10:23,039 --> 00:10:24,000
Then I'll pay you.

200
00:10:26,360 --> 00:10:27,919
Why are you acting like a stranger?

201
00:10:29,120 --> 00:10:30,159
Once I sell my house,

202
00:10:30,679 --> 00:10:32,279
the money for my mom's surgery,

203
00:10:32,480 --> 00:10:33,679
plus what I borrowed from you,

204
00:10:33,759 --> 00:10:34,480
I'll pay it all back.

205
00:10:36,960 --> 00:10:37,720
What are you talking about?

206
00:10:38,039 --> 00:10:39,320
Are you trying to draw a line between us?

207
00:10:41,840 --> 00:10:43,480
Did I do something wrong?

208
00:10:44,600 --> 00:10:45,919
Even real brothers keep clear accounts.

209
00:10:47,480 --> 00:10:48,600
If we're brothers...

210
00:10:50,639 --> 00:10:51,320
Alright.

211
00:10:52,039 --> 00:10:52,919
Brothers it is.

212
00:10:55,200 --> 00:10:55,600
Xing!

213
00:10:55,639 --> 00:10:56,279
Put the monitor here.

214
00:10:56,440 --> 00:10:57,840
All Unit One crew, switch to Channel One.

215
00:10:57,879 --> 00:10:58,679
Unit Two crew, switch to Channel Two.

216
00:10:58,679 --> 00:10:59,480
Copy that, everyone?

217
00:11:00,000 --> 00:11:00,480
Apple box!

218
00:11:00,600 --> 00:11:01,000
Here.

219
00:11:04,399 --> 00:11:04,720
Come closer.

220
00:11:04,720 --> 00:11:05,159
Director Shen, come closer.

221
00:11:05,799 --> 00:11:06,600
The monitor is set up.

222
00:11:08,679 --> 00:11:09,639
Five minutes until it pulls into the station.

223
00:11:09,919 --> 00:11:10,919
Unit One and Unit Two, follow me.

224
00:11:11,159 --> 00:11:11,639
Got it!

225
00:11:12,000 --> 00:11:12,679
Stay safe!

226
00:11:12,799 --> 00:11:13,399
Let's go. On it!

227
00:11:15,519 --> 00:11:15,960
Director!

228
00:11:16,039 --> 00:11:16,679
Ready? The drone is in position.

229
00:11:23,639 --> 00:11:24,840
Old Zhang, how's it looking on your end?

230
00:11:25,799 --> 00:11:26,759
All set, Director!

231
00:11:28,600 --> 00:11:29,240
Stand by.

232
00:11:30,279 --> 00:11:30,840
Action!

233
00:11:39,120 --> 00:11:39,879
Hold it.

234
00:11:40,519 --> 00:11:41,200
The train's coming!

235
00:11:42,480 --> 00:11:43,759
That's good. Head over to the tracks.

236
00:11:44,320 --> 00:11:44,679
Okay.

237
00:11:48,639 --> 00:11:49,720
Looks like there's someone on the tracks!

238
00:11:50,279 --> 00:11:50,639
Where?

239
00:11:57,919 --> 00:11:58,559
Look out! Watch out!

240
00:11:58,639 --> 00:11:59,440
There's someone on the tracks!

241
00:11:59,720 --> 00:12:00,440
Go check it out, quick!

242
00:12:00,639 --> 00:12:01,360
Go check!

243
00:12:01,720 --> 00:12:02,080
Hurry, hurry, hurry!

244
00:12:12,120 --> 00:12:12,960
Clear the way ahead!

245
00:12:13,039 --> 00:12:13,840
Clear the way ahead!

246
00:12:13,879 --> 00:12:14,519
Hurry!

247
00:12:17,000 --> 00:12:18,559
Move! Out of the way!

248
00:12:18,960 --> 00:12:19,559
Director, look!

249
00:12:21,360 --> 00:12:22,200
Don't go over there!

250
00:12:22,639 --> 00:12:23,600
Stop the train!

251
00:12:24,240 --> 00:12:25,159
Stay back!

252
00:12:25,480 --> 00:12:25,919
Stop the train!

253
00:12:25,919 --> 00:12:26,799
Don't go over there!

254
00:12:27,480 --> 00:12:28,159
Stop the train!

255
00:12:28,200 --> 00:12:29,080
Make the train stop!

256
00:12:29,080 --> 00:12:30,000
Stop!

257
00:12:30,559 --> 00:12:31,600
Make it stop!

258
00:12:31,600 --> 00:12:32,679
Stop the train! Stop!

259
00:12:34,559 --> 00:12:35,080
Don't move!

260
00:12:44,519 --> 00:12:45,399
Don't move

261
00:12:54,639 --> 00:12:55,600
Ma Guowen?

262
00:12:59,320 --> 00:13:00,480
The factory director is dead.

263
00:13:01,679 --> 00:13:02,600
Where was he found?

264
00:13:04,120 --> 00:13:04,960
When?

265
00:13:06,519 --> 00:13:08,279
Did forensics and the coroner head over?

266
00:13:09,639 --> 00:13:10,600
I'll be at the office shortly.

267
00:13:11,639 --> 00:13:12,039
Forget it.

268
00:13:12,080 --> 00:13:12,960
Just wait for me downstairs.

269
00:13:14,240 --> 00:13:15,000
Hello, Officer Han.

270
00:13:15,120 --> 00:13:15,919
I'm the new officer.

271
00:13:15,919 --> 00:13:16,720
My name is Gao Xuelin.

272
00:13:16,840 --> 00:13:17,879
Here's my letter of introduction.

273
00:13:18,840 --> 00:13:19,360
Listen, rookie.

274
00:13:19,399 --> 00:13:20,200
Go report to the second floor.

275
00:13:20,200 --> 00:13:20,840
This is the third floor.

276
00:13:21,000 --> 00:13:21,480
Brother Chuang.

277
00:13:23,759 --> 00:13:25,000
A call came in from the Lapi Brewery freight yard.

278
00:13:25,720 --> 00:13:27,240
A man's body was found on the tracks.

279
00:13:27,720 --> 00:13:28,879
The victim is the factory director, Ma Guowen.

280
00:13:29,159 --> 00:13:30,080
Forensics is already on the way.

281
00:13:30,080 --> 00:13:31,519
Captain Cheng, put in a word with Brother Chuang for me.

282
00:13:32,080 --> 00:13:32,759
All right, thanks!

283
00:13:33,240 --> 00:13:33,639
Brother Chuang.

284
00:13:34,120 --> 00:13:34,879
Call from Detachment Chief Cheng.

285
00:13:35,000 --> 00:13:35,639
It's for you.

286
00:13:38,159 --> 00:13:39,720
The kid who handed you the phone is Gao Xuelin.

287
00:13:39,960 --> 00:13:40,799
Transferred from Qingzhou.

288
00:13:40,960 --> 00:13:41,559
He's sharp. I've seen him.

289
00:13:41,600 --> 00:13:42,320
Your team is short-handed, and he's right by me.

290
00:13:42,320 --> 00:13:43,279
Let him shadow you for now.

291
00:13:43,840 --> 00:13:45,000
I'm heading to Lapi Brewery right now.

292
00:13:45,000 --> 00:13:45,759
Someone died over there.

293
00:13:46,000 --> 00:13:46,720
I'm on a case.

294
00:13:46,960 --> 00:13:48,159
Just have him wait in the office.

295
00:13:48,879 --> 00:13:49,399
Right, okay, sure.

296
00:13:50,039 --> 00:13:51,159
Wait in the office for now.

297
00:13:51,240 --> 00:13:51,960
Head over there first.

298
00:13:52,679 --> 00:13:54,159
Chuang, let me come with you to the crime scene!

299
00:13:54,480 --> 00:13:55,279
I can help out!

300
00:13:55,600 --> 00:13:56,440
Logging evidence,

301
00:13:56,440 --> 00:13:57,440
holding back the crowd—I can do it all.

302
00:13:58,080 --> 00:13:59,000
You're something else, kid.

303
00:13:59,720 --> 00:14:01,399
Getting Detachment Chief Cheng to call me personally?

304
00:14:02,360 --> 00:14:03,480
What's your connection to him?

305
00:14:04,360 --> 00:14:05,000
None.

306
00:14:07,279 --> 00:14:07,720
Well, actually...

307
00:14:07,799 --> 00:14:08,559
There is a connection, bro.

308
00:14:09,000 --> 00:14:10,120
My connection is with you.

309
00:14:11,279 --> 00:14:11,919
With me?

310
00:14:11,919 --> 00:14:13,039
What connection do you have with me?

311
00:14:13,759 --> 00:14:15,559
My... my mentor was your classmate.

312
00:14:16,240 --> 00:14:17,360
I've got plenty of classmates.

313
00:14:17,360 --> 00:14:18,440
Half the detectives here are my classmates.

314
00:14:19,279 --> 00:14:20,440
Qiangzi, from your upper bunk.

315
00:14:20,720 --> 00:14:21,480
He's my mentor.

316
00:14:21,679 --> 00:14:22,639
I worked under him for three years.

317
00:14:26,840 --> 00:14:28,440
You're Xu Qiang's mentee?

318
00:14:28,639 --> 00:14:29,159
Yes, sir.

319
00:14:29,519 --> 00:14:31,519
Here's a handwritten letter he wrote to you.

320
00:14:31,759 --> 00:14:32,320
Want to take a look?

321
00:14:33,360 --> 00:14:33,840
A handwritten letter?

322
00:14:34,159 --> 00:14:35,039
Connected to me?

323
00:14:36,519 --> 00:14:37,240
What are you trying to pull?

324
00:14:37,679 --> 00:14:38,320
Just want to work under you.

325
00:14:45,159 --> 00:14:46,000
How did this happen?

326
00:14:46,960 --> 00:14:47,519
Huzi.

327
00:14:48,840 --> 00:14:49,679
I was so close.

328
00:14:51,360 --> 00:14:51,840
Look at this.

329
00:14:51,840 --> 00:14:53,039
Move aside, move aside, move!

330
00:14:53,720 --> 00:14:54,399
Clear the way, everyone!

331
00:14:54,799 --> 00:14:55,679
Step aside, make way!

332
00:15:02,720 --> 00:15:03,600
All right, everyone disperse!

333
00:15:03,759 --> 00:15:04,600
Stop crowding around!

334
00:15:05,159 --> 00:15:06,639
Aren't you Cao Jun, the pedicab driver?

335
00:15:06,919 --> 00:15:08,039
Stop gawking. Move along!

336
00:15:09,720 --> 00:15:11,039
You don't understand me, do you?

337
00:15:11,720 --> 00:15:12,960
If you don't leave by the count of three...

338
00:15:15,720 --> 00:15:16,279
Break it up!

339
00:15:20,279 --> 00:15:21,600
Shunzi, you think I didn't mean you?

340
00:15:21,919 --> 00:15:22,600
How'd he die?

341
00:15:22,600 --> 00:15:24,159
How many people did you bring to gawk today?

342
00:15:24,440 --> 00:15:26,120
We haven't settled that pool hall incident yet.

343
00:15:26,120 --> 00:15:26,840
I've got plenty of squad cars today.

344
00:15:26,840 --> 00:15:27,480
I can take you all in!

345
00:15:27,480 --> 00:15:27,960
Go, go, go.

346
00:15:28,080 --> 00:15:29,759
We're leaving, we're leaving.

347
00:15:30,759 --> 00:15:31,399
Let's go, let's go.

348
00:15:31,399 --> 00:15:32,039
Look at them.

349
00:15:33,919 --> 00:15:34,960
They sure love a spectacle.

350
00:15:37,399 --> 00:15:38,120
The caller said

351
00:15:38,120 --> 00:15:39,320
when the body was found,

352
00:15:39,480 --> 00:15:40,919
a black plastic bag was over the head.

353
00:15:41,519 --> 00:15:42,559
When they took it off,

354
00:15:42,559 --> 00:15:44,200
a beer bottle cap was embedded in the forehead.

355
00:15:44,519 --> 00:15:45,639
They were filming at the time,

356
00:15:46,039 --> 00:15:46,840
so they caught it all on tape.

357
00:15:47,240 --> 00:15:48,320
Who authorized them to film?

358
00:15:49,000 --> 00:15:50,759
They were shooting a factory promo.

359
00:15:52,720 --> 00:15:53,360
They called it in?

360
00:15:54,080 --> 00:15:54,519
Yes.

361
00:15:55,039 --> 00:15:56,759
Take them back and get their statements first.

362
00:15:56,759 --> 00:15:57,080
Okay.

363
00:15:58,200 --> 00:15:59,799
Who's in charge around here?

364
00:16:00,159 --> 00:16:00,919
Old Qian! Old Qian!

365
00:16:01,159 --> 00:16:02,519
Old Qian! Where is he?

366
00:16:03,399 --> 00:16:03,919
Name.

367
00:16:04,120 --> 00:16:04,679
Occupation?

368
00:16:05,159 --> 00:16:05,799
Qian the Cripple.

369
00:16:05,960 --> 00:16:06,639
Gatekeeper.

370
00:16:09,080 --> 00:16:10,559
Is that the name on your ID?

371
00:16:10,720 --> 00:16:11,440
Qian the Cripple?

372
00:16:12,120 --> 00:16:13,200
"Qian" as in money-grubbing.

373
00:16:14,200 --> 00:16:15,159
"Yi" as in ungrateful backstabber.

374
00:16:16,120 --> 00:16:17,080
"Chuan" as in tiger brought low on a plain.

375
00:16:17,080 --> 00:16:17,799
Qian Yichuan.

376
00:16:18,519 --> 00:16:19,399
Who died over there?

377
00:16:19,759 --> 00:16:20,480
Ma Guowen?

378
00:16:21,879 --> 00:16:22,720
How'd he die?

379
00:16:23,320 --> 00:16:24,480
Hit by a train?

380
00:16:25,879 --> 00:16:26,799
None of your business.

381
00:16:28,679 --> 00:16:29,799
Do you have surveillance cameras here?

382
00:16:30,000 --> 00:16:30,440
No.

383
00:16:30,519 --> 00:16:30,960
None.

384
00:16:31,200 --> 00:16:32,399
Been broken for ages.

385
00:16:32,960 --> 00:16:34,759
Requested repairs from Ma Guowen,

386
00:16:34,879 --> 00:16:35,519
but he said no need.

387
00:16:35,519 --> 00:16:36,679
Said I'm a human security camera,

388
00:16:36,679 --> 00:16:37,399
so those gadgets are useless.

389
00:16:38,039 --> 00:16:40,240
Cruising in a Benz yesterday, living large,

390
00:16:40,279 --> 00:16:41,559
and today he ended up frozen solid like a pear.

391
00:16:41,679 --> 00:16:43,000
You got a grudge against Ma Guowen?

392
00:16:45,320 --> 00:16:45,879
No, why?

393
00:16:46,559 --> 00:16:47,799
Then why the snide remarks?

394
00:16:48,639 --> 00:16:49,200
Well,

395
00:16:50,000 --> 00:16:51,320
he's not my father.

396
00:16:51,360 --> 00:16:52,960
No reason for me to mourn him, right?

397
00:16:53,679 --> 00:16:54,879
Stop cracking melon seeds!

398
00:16:55,320 --> 00:16:56,200
Throwing shells all over the floor.

399
00:16:56,399 --> 00:16:57,759
This is a crime scene, you know that?

400
00:16:58,679 --> 00:16:59,919
Are you all from the factory?

401
00:16:59,919 --> 00:17:00,679
Yes, all from the factory.

402
00:17:00,679 --> 00:17:01,720
Yes, right, all from the factory.

403
00:17:01,720 --> 00:17:02,240
Xiao Wu.

404
00:17:02,600 --> 00:17:04,960
Have them write down their names and numbers.

405
00:17:05,640 --> 00:17:07,000
There's been an incident at your factory.

406
00:17:07,880 --> 00:17:09,440
Nobody leaves Lacheng anytime soon.

407
00:17:09,640 --> 00:17:11,400
We might call you at any time.

408
00:17:11,400 --> 00:17:11,880
Understood?

409
00:17:12,079 --> 00:17:12,759
Understood, understood.

410
00:17:12,759 --> 00:17:13,119
Yes, loud and clear.

411
00:17:13,240 --> 00:17:14,279
All right then, disperse.

412
00:17:14,720 --> 00:17:16,079
Don't leave footprints or fingerprints here.

413
00:17:16,079 --> 00:17:17,160
You'll only bring trouble on yourselves.

414
00:17:17,480 --> 00:17:17,880
Got it.

415
00:17:18,279 --> 00:17:18,720
Let's go.

416
00:17:19,599 --> 00:17:20,359
Let's clear out then. Come on.

417
00:17:20,400 --> 00:17:21,359
Let's go, let's go, let's go.

418
00:17:26,039 --> 00:17:26,720
Are you free tonight? About this...

419
00:17:26,720 --> 00:17:27,480
Come over to my place for drinks.

420
00:17:28,240 --> 00:17:29,440
Can't do tonight, bro.

421
00:17:29,440 --> 00:17:30,400
I've got the night shift.

422
00:17:31,160 --> 00:17:31,759
What shift?

423
00:17:32,119 --> 00:17:33,160
The boss is dead.

424
00:17:33,160 --> 00:17:33,799
You're still working?

425
00:17:33,799 --> 00:17:34,440
You're unbelievable.

426
00:17:34,759 --> 00:17:35,640
Who's paying your wages?

427
00:17:39,720 --> 00:17:40,599
I have two findings.

428
00:17:40,640 --> 00:17:41,640
Wanted to run them by you.

429
00:17:42,119 --> 00:17:42,599
Go ahead.

430
00:17:42,799 --> 00:17:44,640
First, I think Qian Yichuan's a bit odd.

431
00:17:45,720 --> 00:17:46,400
How so?

432
00:17:47,039 --> 00:17:49,440
His limp probably wasn't from birth.

433
00:17:49,960 --> 00:17:51,039
It looks like an acquired injury.

434
00:17:51,640 --> 00:17:53,160
I've seen similar cases before.

435
00:17:53,480 --> 00:17:54,359
Must've severed a tendon,

436
00:17:54,359 --> 00:17:55,079
and it didn't heal right.

437
00:17:56,799 --> 00:17:58,599
Qian Yichuan's foot...

438
00:18:00,000 --> 00:18:02,720
Ma Guowen's men slashed his tendon.

439
00:18:04,160 --> 00:18:05,839
No wonder he held such a grudge against the victim.

440
00:18:06,920 --> 00:18:08,119
I remember that case.

441
00:18:11,440 --> 00:18:12,079
Xiao Wu.

442
00:18:12,519 --> 00:18:13,640
Did you get the numbers and addresses

443
00:18:13,640 --> 00:18:15,039
of those factory workers earlier?

444
00:18:16,279 --> 00:18:17,200
Give that...

445
00:18:17,720 --> 00:18:19,000
Qian Yichuan a call.

446
00:18:19,359 --> 00:18:20,440
Tell him to come down to our station.

447
00:18:21,319 --> 00:18:22,839
Find out what he was really doing last night.

448
00:18:23,319 --> 00:18:24,240
Make him a priority suspect.

449
00:18:26,559 --> 00:18:27,119
Right, got it.

450
00:18:28,039 --> 00:18:29,720
He tidied up around here last night,

451
00:18:29,720 --> 00:18:31,039
then went drinking with his coworkers.

452
00:18:31,240 --> 00:18:32,119
Someone vouched for him.

453
00:18:35,720 --> 00:18:37,039
My second finding is...

454
00:18:37,039 --> 00:18:38,400
I don't think this was

455
00:18:38,400 --> 00:18:39,519
Ma Guowen's primary crime scene.

456
00:18:39,920 --> 00:18:40,720
How do you know?

457
00:18:41,519 --> 00:18:43,079
The victim only wore a sweater.

458
00:18:43,519 --> 00:18:44,960
In the dead of night, in this freezing cold,

459
00:18:45,079 --> 00:18:46,240
he couldn't have lasted out here.

460
00:18:46,680 --> 00:18:48,720
He must've been in a warm place when alive,

461
00:18:48,799 --> 00:18:50,079
and dumped here after he died.

462
00:18:52,680 --> 00:18:53,559
What do you think, Boss?

463
00:19:08,319 --> 00:19:09,359
Do you know why,

464
00:19:09,920 --> 00:19:11,000
the very first time we met,

465
00:19:11,039 --> 00:19:12,839
I brought you along on such a big case?

466
00:19:15,599 --> 00:19:16,839
Out of respect for my mentor.

467
00:19:18,200 --> 00:19:19,519
Back when your mentor and I were in school,

468
00:19:20,240 --> 00:19:21,599
we were a golden duo.

469
00:19:22,079 --> 00:19:22,920
We complemented each other,

470
00:19:23,440 --> 00:19:25,279
and we always saw eye to eye.

471
00:19:26,559 --> 00:19:27,440
Right now,

472
00:19:28,279 --> 00:19:29,039
let's head to the factory office

473
00:19:29,400 --> 00:19:30,559
and find the warmest room.

474
00:19:34,039 --> 00:19:35,720
Is the director's office warm enough?

475
00:19:40,359 --> 00:19:41,079
Can you open this door?

476
00:19:41,759 --> 00:19:42,680
I don't have the key.

477
00:19:43,200 --> 00:19:44,680
The director has it.

478
00:19:48,160 --> 00:19:49,319
Was something hanging here before?

479
00:19:50,119 --> 00:19:50,599
Yes.

480
00:19:50,880 --> 00:19:51,559
Right here,

481
00:19:51,599 --> 00:19:52,400
there used to be a picture frame.

482
00:19:52,599 --> 00:19:53,519
It broke a couple of days ago,

483
00:19:53,839 --> 00:19:55,079
and the director got a new one.

484
00:19:55,200 --> 00:19:56,079
He just took it—

485
00:19:58,039 --> 00:19:59,319
The director left without locking the door.

486
00:20:04,240 --> 00:20:05,039
Is it this frame?

487
00:20:05,039 --> 00:20:05,680
The one hanging outside?

488
00:20:05,920 --> 00:20:07,640
Yeah. How did it break again?

489
00:20:09,160 --> 00:20:10,720
Where are the bottle caps from before?

490
00:20:10,759 --> 00:20:11,319
What bottle caps?

491
00:20:11,880 --> 00:20:13,079
The ones our director collected.

492
00:20:13,440 --> 00:20:14,720
Commemorative millennium edition.

493
00:20:14,960 --> 00:20:17,480
They were arranged in the shape of "2000."

494
00:20:19,960 --> 00:20:20,960
This room is pretty clean.

495
00:20:21,039 --> 00:20:22,319
Did you clean it today?

496
00:20:22,640 --> 00:20:23,359
No, I didn't.

497
00:20:24,279 --> 00:20:25,279
Usually, our director

498
00:20:25,440 --> 00:20:27,079
doesn't let us clean in here alone.

499
00:20:27,519 --> 00:20:28,720
It's only when he's around

500
00:20:28,720 --> 00:20:29,839
that he lets us tidy up.

501
00:20:30,359 --> 00:20:30,839
Besides,

502
00:20:30,839 --> 00:20:31,640
his desk

503
00:20:31,759 --> 00:20:32,880
and over by the safe,

504
00:20:33,039 --> 00:20:33,920
he never lets us go near them.

505
00:20:35,279 --> 00:20:36,359
So he cleans it himself?

506
00:20:38,599 --> 00:20:40,039
The factory is about to be sold,

507
00:20:40,200 --> 00:20:41,039
business is bad,

508
00:20:41,160 --> 00:20:42,400
and he's stressed out.

509
00:20:42,759 --> 00:20:44,000
Why would he bother

510
00:20:44,000 --> 00:20:45,119
cleaning the office?

511
00:20:47,079 --> 00:20:47,720
Ma'am,

512
00:20:48,240 --> 00:20:49,839
when you clean around here,

513
00:20:49,880 --> 00:20:50,640
is this all you wear?

514
00:20:51,400 --> 00:20:51,839
Yeah.

515
00:20:53,039 --> 00:20:53,519
Aren't you cold?

516
00:20:54,000 --> 00:20:54,640
Not really.

517
00:20:55,920 --> 00:20:56,720
This place,

518
00:20:57,160 --> 00:20:58,240
though it's not doing well,

519
00:20:58,319 --> 00:20:59,359
the heating's still pretty good.

520
00:21:00,119 --> 00:21:01,039
They don't skimp on coal.

521
00:21:02,359 --> 00:21:03,240
I felt warm walking in too.

522
00:21:05,039 --> 00:21:06,079
Did you see the director yesterday?

523
00:21:06,920 --> 00:21:07,680
Yes, I did.

524
00:21:07,920 --> 00:21:09,720
Do you remember what he was wearing?

525
00:21:13,880 --> 00:21:14,480
Just that...

526
00:21:15,000 --> 00:21:15,920
that black mink coat.

527
00:21:17,480 --> 00:21:18,000
This one?

528
00:21:19,279 --> 00:21:20,640
He wears this black mink all the time.

529
00:21:22,960 --> 00:21:23,880
Is this his bag?

530
00:21:24,000 --> 00:21:24,839
Yes, it is.

531
00:21:27,119 --> 00:21:27,559
All right.

532
00:21:28,319 --> 00:21:29,160
If anything else comes up,

533
00:21:29,319 --> 00:21:29,880
I'll call you.

534
00:21:30,200 --> 00:21:31,119
Sure, sure.

535
00:21:36,200 --> 00:21:37,319
Seal off this floor immediately.

536
00:21:37,680 --> 00:21:39,079
Have forensics come in to investigate.

537
00:21:39,319 --> 00:21:41,400
This is likely the primary crime scene.

538
00:21:42,559 --> 00:21:43,079
Copy that.

539
00:21:58,720 --> 00:21:59,440
Here's some water.

540
00:22:00,480 --> 00:22:02,680
I was so busy earlier, I didn't even say hi.

541
00:22:03,440 --> 00:22:04,160
Old classmate.

542
00:22:04,839 --> 00:22:05,799
When did you get back to Lacheng?

543
00:22:06,079 --> 00:22:06,799
Classmate?

544
00:22:10,039 --> 00:22:11,440
We went to Lacheng No. 1 High together.

545
00:22:12,079 --> 00:22:12,880
Teacher Yang...

546
00:22:13,400 --> 00:22:14,119
Do you remember?

547
00:22:14,720 --> 00:22:17,000
Our class had four troublemakers.

548
00:22:18,160 --> 00:22:19,880
Whenever Teacher Yang took study hall,

549
00:22:19,920 --> 00:22:20,880
she'd push open the door and shout,

550
00:22:20,960 --> 00:22:22,640
"Zhang Qiu, Zhang Lei, Sun Di, Sun Jinfu,

551
00:22:22,680 --> 00:22:23,279
get out here!"

552
00:22:26,119 --> 00:22:27,559
Good to see you, Sun Jinfu.

553
00:22:30,599 --> 00:22:32,000
I... I'm Han Chuang.

554
00:22:41,000 --> 00:22:41,880
We really were classmates.

555
00:22:45,480 --> 00:22:45,880
Anyway,

556
00:22:45,920 --> 00:22:46,640
just routine procedure.

557
00:22:47,839 --> 00:22:48,799
A few questions for you.

558
00:22:49,400 --> 00:22:49,799
Now then,

559
00:22:49,880 --> 00:22:52,200
according to Ma Guowen's driver,

560
00:22:52,759 --> 00:22:54,119
yesterday at noon,

561
00:22:54,319 --> 00:22:55,440
at 12:15,

562
00:22:55,480 --> 00:22:57,000
you got into Ma Guowen's car.

563
00:22:58,119 --> 00:22:58,680
Yes.

564
00:22:59,480 --> 00:23:01,720
He asked me to film a documentary for the factory.

565
00:23:06,200 --> 00:23:07,599
He gave me a 30,000 deposit.

566
00:23:08,039 --> 00:23:08,599
It's all here.

567
00:23:08,799 --> 00:23:09,480
I'm handing it over to you.

568
00:23:10,160 --> 00:23:10,839
Well,

569
00:23:10,920 --> 00:23:12,200
that has nothing to do with this case.

570
00:23:12,200 --> 00:23:12,920
Put it away.

571
00:23:14,400 --> 00:23:16,400
He told me this morning

572
00:23:16,400 --> 00:23:18,039
to go to the factory to sign the contract.

573
00:23:20,599 --> 00:23:21,680
Chuang, come outside for a second.

574
00:23:22,039 --> 00:23:22,960
Captain Cheng wants to see you.

575
00:23:24,200 --> 00:23:24,720
This...

576
00:23:24,799 --> 00:23:25,519
Put it away.

577
00:23:46,079 --> 00:23:48,160
You used to work at Lacheng TV Station.

578
00:23:50,599 --> 00:23:51,920
That was over a decade ago.

579
00:23:52,640 --> 00:23:54,079
You shot a film for the brewery.

580
00:23:54,640 --> 00:23:56,160
The documentary "The Malt Kingdom."

581
00:23:56,720 --> 00:23:57,400
What year was that?

582
00:23:58,920 --> 00:23:59,799
1999.

583
00:24:00,000 --> 00:24:01,640
Did you meet Ma Guowen while filming?

584
00:24:03,519 --> 00:24:04,359
I interviewed him.

585
00:24:05,480 --> 00:24:06,640
But we never had any private contact.

586
00:24:08,440 --> 00:24:09,480
That documentary of yours...

587
00:24:09,480 --> 00:24:11,440
which months did you shoot it in 1999?

588
00:24:13,960 --> 00:24:15,119
In 1999...

589
00:24:16,400 --> 00:24:19,759
from early October to early November.

590
00:24:23,519 --> 00:24:24,160
That can't be right.

591
00:24:25,240 --> 00:24:27,039
On December 31st, 1999,

592
00:24:27,799 --> 00:24:28,839
there was an auction.

593
00:24:29,519 --> 00:24:31,119
I believe you went there with your camera.

594
00:24:37,839 --> 00:24:38,799
Let me jog your memory.

595
00:24:40,160 --> 00:24:41,920
December 31st, 1999.

596
00:24:41,920 --> 00:24:42,559
New Year's Eve.

597
00:24:43,599 --> 00:24:44,799
It was bitterly cold that night.

598
00:24:45,759 --> 00:24:47,240
Someone froze to death, didn't they?

599
00:24:48,079 --> 00:24:48,519
What happened?

600
00:24:48,519 --> 00:24:49,119
What's wrong?

601
00:24:49,680 --> 00:24:50,279
What is it?

602
00:24:50,680 --> 00:24:51,480
She had too much to drink.

603
00:24:52,400 --> 00:24:53,559
What if she wandered off and got lost?

604
00:24:54,319 --> 00:24:55,039
What's going on?

605
00:24:56,160 --> 00:24:56,759
She froze to death.

606
00:25:06,599 --> 00:25:08,480
I think that happened.

607
00:25:09,119 --> 00:25:09,880
You think?

608
00:25:10,599 --> 00:25:11,519
Don't you remember?

609
00:25:12,240 --> 00:25:13,880
You even did a special report on it.

610
00:25:18,400 --> 00:25:18,920
Yes.

611
00:25:19,400 --> 00:25:20,440
That day,

612
00:25:20,640 --> 00:25:21,759
the temperature dropped sharply overnight.

613
00:25:22,880 --> 00:25:24,599
A woman froze to death on Xingfu Road.

614
00:25:25,519 --> 00:25:26,400
Early the next morning,

615
00:25:26,400 --> 00:25:28,240
the station sent me to cover the story.

616
00:25:28,960 --> 00:25:30,119
What did you film that day?

617
00:25:33,799 --> 00:25:34,680
What did I film?

618
00:25:34,680 --> 00:25:37,680
You can check the station's archives from back then.

619
00:25:38,599 --> 00:25:39,920
They should still have them.

620
00:25:43,119 --> 00:25:44,079
That...

621
00:25:44,359 --> 00:25:45,880
What was the dead woman's name?

622
00:25:50,880 --> 00:25:51,640
Liu Xuemei.

623
00:25:52,720 --> 00:25:53,400
Liu Xuemei.

624
00:25:54,319 --> 00:25:55,079
Did you know her?

625
00:25:56,599 --> 00:25:57,200
I'd interviewed her.

626
00:25:57,799 --> 00:25:58,559
Were you close with her?

627
00:25:59,599 --> 00:26:00,200
Not really.

628
00:26:06,319 --> 00:26:09,559
It seems she accidentally froze to death while drunk.

629
00:26:09,880 --> 00:26:12,119
Do you know the specifics of what happened?

630
00:26:13,119 --> 00:26:14,240
Was she really drunk?

631
00:26:14,799 --> 00:26:15,599
Who was she drinking with?

632
00:26:17,480 --> 00:26:19,160
Y-You're asking me?

633
00:26:19,160 --> 00:26:20,319
How would I know?

634
00:26:21,720 --> 00:26:22,720
Officer,

635
00:26:23,119 --> 00:26:24,960
someone freezing to death back in '99...

636
00:26:24,960 --> 00:26:27,000
what does that have to do with today's case?

637
00:26:28,480 --> 00:26:29,599
If it didn't, I wouldn't be asking.

638
00:26:30,240 --> 00:26:31,160
Please cooperate.

639
00:26:32,079 --> 00:26:33,440
I'm not a suspect.

640
00:26:33,440 --> 00:26:34,599
I've answered everything I could.

641
00:26:34,599 --> 00:26:35,759
Can I leave now?

642
00:26:35,759 --> 00:26:37,000
I'm not done with my questions.

643
00:26:37,480 --> 00:26:38,680
Please be patient and cooperate.

644
00:26:41,200 --> 00:26:42,720
I've been out since before dawn.

645
00:26:43,359 --> 00:26:46,119
Freezing, starving, terrified.

646
00:26:46,359 --> 00:26:47,599
I feel like throwing up right now.

647
00:26:47,680 --> 00:26:48,799
I want to go back, take a shower,

648
00:26:48,839 --> 00:26:49,400
and get some sleep.

649
00:26:49,400 --> 00:26:50,960
Can't you cut me some slack?

650
00:26:52,480 --> 00:26:53,319
This is a serious case.

651
00:26:53,480 --> 00:26:54,559
Please be patient and cooperate.

652
00:26:55,720 --> 00:26:57,319
How can I be patient?

653
00:26:58,160 --> 00:26:59,680
Everything you ask has nothing to do with this!

654
00:26:59,680 --> 00:27:00,960
How am I supposed to cooperate?

655
00:27:04,039 --> 00:27:04,880
What's going on?

656
00:27:06,839 --> 00:27:07,440
What's happening?

657
00:27:08,400 --> 00:27:09,440
He keeps asking me

658
00:27:09,440 --> 00:27:11,000
about the documentary back in '99,

659
00:27:11,359 --> 00:27:12,880
about that freeze-to-death case back in '99.

660
00:27:12,880 --> 00:27:13,759
What does that have to do with me?

661
00:27:13,759 --> 00:27:15,240
What does that have to do with this case?

662
00:27:15,920 --> 00:27:16,400
Don't get worked up.

663
00:27:16,559 --> 00:27:16,880
Easy now.

664
00:27:16,960 --> 00:27:17,559
Sit down, sit down.

665
00:27:18,960 --> 00:27:19,599
What's going on?

666
00:27:20,039 --> 00:27:21,960
Are you still in touch with anyone from the brewery?

667
00:27:26,440 --> 00:27:27,279
Her husband,

668
00:27:27,400 --> 00:27:28,319
Zhao Haipeng,

669
00:27:28,880 --> 00:27:30,799
was the head of publicity at Lapi Brewery.

670
00:27:33,240 --> 00:27:34,000
Ex-husband.

671
00:27:35,240 --> 00:27:36,599
Former head of publicity.

672
00:27:39,480 --> 00:27:39,920
All right.

673
00:27:40,000 --> 00:27:40,799
For today,

674
00:27:41,160 --> 00:27:41,880
let's wrap it up here.

675
00:27:42,720 --> 00:27:43,319
And then,

676
00:27:43,400 --> 00:27:44,559
you go back and get some rest.

677
00:27:46,599 --> 00:27:47,200
Just...

678
00:27:48,680 --> 00:27:49,680
don't leave Lacheng anytime soon.

679
00:27:52,279 --> 00:27:53,079
I can't leave?

680
00:27:55,400 --> 00:27:56,640
I... I have things to do tomorrow.

681
00:27:56,640 --> 00:27:57,880
I have to head back to Beijing tomorrow!

682
00:27:58,039 --> 00:27:59,440
You got into Ma Guowen's car,

683
00:27:59,480 --> 00:28:00,519
took his money,

684
00:28:00,960 --> 00:28:02,720
and showed up at the crime scene early this morning.

685
00:28:03,480 --> 00:28:04,519
You're also the one who reported it.

686
00:28:05,160 --> 00:28:06,519
The investigation has just started.

687
00:28:06,880 --> 00:28:07,920
Do you really think you can leave?

688
00:28:18,119 --> 00:28:18,640
Fine.

689
00:28:19,400 --> 00:28:20,160
Just my bad luck.

690
00:28:20,440 --> 00:28:21,640
Nothing goes right for me.

691
00:28:22,000 --> 00:28:23,079
Well, you know...

692
00:28:23,279 --> 00:28:23,880
Everyone...

693
00:28:24,200 --> 00:28:25,519
has bad days sometimes,

694
00:28:25,599 --> 00:28:26,000
right?

695
00:28:26,759 --> 00:28:27,519
Here, come on.

696
00:28:27,920 --> 00:28:29,079
Don't worry, old classmate.

697
00:28:29,400 --> 00:28:30,480
Go home, take a shower,

698
00:28:30,480 --> 00:28:31,200
and get some rest.

699
00:28:32,240 --> 00:28:32,720
Also...

700
00:28:33,039 --> 00:28:34,119
Here's my number.

701
00:28:34,720 --> 00:28:36,160
Call me if anything comes up.

702
00:28:39,960 --> 00:28:42,319
Please leave the equipment you used for filming today.

703
00:28:42,599 --> 00:28:44,279
We need it for our investigation and backup.

704
00:28:46,279 --> 00:28:48,000
I rented all that gear with my own money.

705
00:28:48,359 --> 00:28:49,160
They charge by the day.

706
00:28:50,480 --> 00:28:51,480
You don't need to leave the gear.

707
00:28:52,119 --> 00:28:53,240
Just leave the cards.

708
00:28:56,160 --> 00:28:57,079
Please write me a receipt.

709
00:29:06,359 --> 00:29:07,039
Take care.

710
00:29:17,160 --> 00:29:18,000
Come on, get in the car first.

711
00:29:18,599 --> 00:29:19,240
You all right?

712
00:29:20,119 --> 00:29:21,400
Is Lili done with her prenatal checkup?

713
00:29:21,400 --> 00:29:21,720
Yeah.

714
00:29:21,880 --> 00:29:23,079
Once that was done, I came right over.

715
00:29:23,839 --> 00:29:24,359
Get in the car first.

716
00:29:27,880 --> 00:29:28,839
What did the police say to you?

717
00:29:30,000 --> 00:29:30,920
Just grilled me with questions.

718
00:29:32,279 --> 00:29:34,079
How did Ma Guowen end up dead like that?

719
00:29:34,079 --> 00:29:35,240
Who could've done it?

720
00:29:35,400 --> 00:29:36,599
Who knows?

721
00:29:37,799 --> 00:29:39,079
He must've pissed someone off.

722
00:29:39,440 --> 00:29:40,720
You know what he was like.

723
00:29:45,119 --> 00:29:46,599
Who could hate him that much?

724
00:29:53,720 --> 00:29:54,559
Lately, you...

725
00:29:54,960 --> 00:29:55,839
shouldn't go out much.

726
00:29:56,480 --> 00:29:57,039
You hear me?

727
00:29:58,079 --> 00:29:59,559
And don't contact those old-timers.

728
00:30:00,599 --> 00:30:02,359
Why would I ever contact them?

729
00:30:06,359 --> 00:30:07,200
All right, come on.

730
00:30:08,400 --> 00:30:09,200
I'll treat you to hot pot.

731
00:30:09,920 --> 00:30:10,559
To calm your nerves.

732
00:30:10,599 --> 00:30:11,279
No, don't worry about it.

733
00:30:11,799 --> 00:30:13,119
I haven't had a chance to see my mom yet.

734
00:30:13,160 --> 00:30:13,759
I'm going to go check on her.

735
00:30:14,039 --> 00:30:14,839
Wait, wait.

736
00:30:15,519 --> 00:30:16,240
That's right on the way.

737
00:30:16,680 --> 00:30:17,279
I'll give you a ride.

738
00:30:28,319 --> 00:30:28,839
Chuang.

739
00:30:29,039 --> 00:30:31,720
The ME confirmed the bottle cap on the victim's forehead

740
00:30:31,839 --> 00:30:33,599
was embedded postmortem.

741
00:30:34,599 --> 00:30:35,039
Look here.

742
00:30:35,720 --> 00:30:37,640
Left cranial damage,

743
00:30:38,240 --> 00:30:40,160
struck with a blunt object while still alive.

744
00:30:40,640 --> 00:30:42,359
Notice the facial swelling and bruising,

745
00:30:42,559 --> 00:30:43,680
conjunctival hemorrhage,

746
00:30:44,160 --> 00:30:45,440
and lacerations around the nose and mouth

747
00:30:45,440 --> 00:30:46,880
with localized subcutaneous bleeding.

748
00:30:47,559 --> 00:30:48,839
Preliminary cause of death

749
00:30:49,559 --> 00:30:51,240
is severe craniocerebral trauma.

750
00:30:51,519 --> 00:30:52,480
Time of death?

751
00:30:52,960 --> 00:30:55,480
Between 11:00 p.m. and midnight.

752
00:30:56,319 --> 00:30:58,440
Any further findings from Ma Guowen's office?

753
00:30:59,200 --> 00:31:01,920
Forensics only found the victim's blood.

754
00:31:02,119 --> 00:31:03,920
No other biological traces were found.

755
00:31:04,519 --> 00:31:05,960
Nothing on the shattered glass frame either.

756
00:31:06,279 --> 00:31:07,839
The scene was meticulously cleaned.

757
00:31:08,160 --> 00:31:09,839
It's preliminarily confirmed as the primary scene.

758
00:31:11,000 --> 00:31:13,079
A meticulously cleaned crime scene...

759
00:31:13,160 --> 00:31:16,000
That means the killer had plenty of time.

760
00:31:17,319 --> 00:31:18,480
Ma Guowen

761
00:31:19,039 --> 00:31:19,960
didn't put up a fight,

762
00:31:20,960 --> 00:31:22,880
which suggests it was someone he knew.

763
00:31:27,680 --> 00:31:28,559
This bottle cap...

764
00:31:28,559 --> 00:31:30,720
It doesn't match the ones currently used

765
00:31:30,799 --> 00:31:31,720
by Lapi Brewery.

766
00:31:34,920 --> 00:31:36,000
Go look into this bottle cap.

767
00:31:36,359 --> 00:31:36,759
Got it.

768
00:31:37,880 --> 00:31:39,759
You didn't even tell me you were coming back.

769
00:31:40,880 --> 00:31:41,839
Showing up out of the blue...

770
00:31:41,880 --> 00:31:43,319
Are you trying to give me a heart attack?

771
00:31:43,920 --> 00:31:45,440
How have you been feeling lately?

772
00:31:45,480 --> 00:31:47,480
My heart's fine. I'm doing great.

773
00:31:48,599 --> 00:31:51,079
If Haipeng hadn't rushed me to the hospital

774
00:31:51,519 --> 00:31:52,680
for emergency bypass surgery,

775
00:31:52,759 --> 00:31:54,160
who'd be making your favorite food now?

776
00:31:54,559 --> 00:31:56,599
You've been saying that for years.

777
00:31:56,599 --> 00:31:58,240
I tried to give him money, but he wouldn't take it.

778
00:31:58,880 --> 00:32:00,400
Now that his wife has had a baby,

779
00:32:00,400 --> 00:32:01,160
we'll give him a hefty red envelope.

780
00:32:01,240 --> 00:32:01,920
Then we won't owe him anything.

781
00:32:02,880 --> 00:32:05,160
If only you had half of his good temper.

782
00:32:07,519 --> 00:32:09,480
Did they have a boy?

783
00:32:10,359 --> 00:32:11,000
What?

784
00:32:11,200 --> 00:32:12,599
You still favor boys over girls?

785
00:32:13,119 --> 00:32:14,599
Why are you biting my head off?

786
00:32:14,920 --> 00:32:15,480
Let me tell you,

787
00:32:15,480 --> 00:32:16,079
you're not getting any younger.

788
00:32:16,079 --> 00:32:16,880
You're well past the age.

789
00:32:17,119 --> 00:32:19,319
Hurry up, find a decent guy, and get married.

790
00:32:19,319 --> 00:32:20,039
Fine, fine, fine.

791
00:32:20,039 --> 00:32:21,440
Isn't that why I'm selling the apartment?

792
00:32:21,440 --> 00:32:23,000
I'm moving to Yunnan

793
00:32:23,000 --> 00:32:24,680
to open a B&B with a friend.

794
00:32:24,680 --> 00:32:25,599
Once it's set up, I'll bring you over.

795
00:32:25,960 --> 00:32:26,839
What are you digging for?

796
00:32:27,160 --> 00:32:27,920
Looking for a pair of shoes.

797
00:32:28,640 --> 00:32:29,480
Put everything back when you're done!

798
00:32:29,759 --> 00:32:30,000
Okay.

799
00:32:30,000 --> 00:32:31,079
Hurry up, or just wear this pair!

800
00:32:31,119 --> 00:32:31,960
Don't worry, don't worry.

801
00:32:32,240 --> 00:32:32,920
Almost done, almost done.

802
00:32:32,960 --> 00:32:34,039
I'll tidy up, I will.

803
00:32:34,039 --> 00:32:34,640
Go back to whatever you were doing.

804
00:33:22,079 --> 00:33:23,000
A foot wash is 50.

805
00:33:23,000 --> 00:33:24,880
Aren't the seeds, peanuts, and tea free?

806
00:33:25,160 --> 00:33:26,079
Fine, fine, fine.

807
00:33:26,079 --> 00:33:26,880
Here.

808
00:33:28,359 --> 00:33:28,759
Jeez.

809
00:33:29,119 --> 00:33:30,160
Your hands are filthy.

810
00:33:30,279 --> 00:33:31,039
I'll clip your nails later.

811
00:33:33,559 --> 00:33:34,880
What do you think you're doing?

812
00:33:36,480 --> 00:33:38,000
Why are you making such a scene?

813
00:33:38,519 --> 00:33:39,880
Quite a grand entrance, huh?

814
00:33:40,039 --> 00:33:42,279
Letting the whole hallway know you're back.

815
00:33:42,960 --> 00:33:43,880
Tu Chunyan.

816
00:33:44,880 --> 00:33:46,559
What? Don't recognize me?

817
00:33:47,200 --> 00:33:48,759
You're hardly ever home,

818
00:33:49,000 --> 00:33:50,279
so I put two empty beer crates

819
00:33:50,319 --> 00:33:51,640
outside your door. So what?

820
00:33:51,799 --> 00:33:52,720
Don't you have hands?

821
00:33:52,720 --> 00:33:54,000
Couldn't you just move them yourself?

822
00:33:54,039 --> 00:33:55,079
And you reported me?

823
00:33:55,079 --> 00:33:56,079
Always running to tattle.

824
00:33:56,720 --> 00:33:58,240
Public sanitation is everyone's duty.

825
00:33:59,240 --> 00:33:59,960
What duty do you have?

826
00:34:00,000 --> 00:34:01,160
All you do is run your mouth.

827
00:34:01,160 --> 00:34:02,839
Sell your place and get the hell out.

828
00:34:06,640 --> 00:34:07,400
Disgusting.

829
00:34:08,159 --> 00:34:09,159
Why is she back?

830
00:34:11,119 --> 00:34:12,159
I'm telling you, it's pointless

831
00:34:12,159 --> 00:34:13,480
wasting your breath on her.

832
00:34:14,119 --> 00:34:14,719
If I were you,

833
00:34:14,719 --> 00:34:16,239
I'd just go up and slap her twice,

834
00:34:16,239 --> 00:34:17,039
knock her right into place.

835
00:34:17,679 --> 00:34:18,280
Shameless bitch.

836
00:34:18,320 --> 00:34:20,000
Back to shoot a movie for Ma Guowen again.

837
00:34:20,400 --> 00:34:21,320
I suspected it back then.

838
00:34:21,320 --> 00:34:23,000
She and Liu Xuemei sold us out.

839
00:34:23,480 --> 00:34:24,079
Right?

840
00:34:24,199 --> 00:34:25,360
Otherwise, how else would Ma Guowen

841
00:34:25,360 --> 00:34:26,880
know our bottom line?

842
00:34:27,559 --> 00:34:28,280
We were idiots too,

843
00:34:28,280 --> 00:34:30,679
blabbing everything right into that camera.

844
00:34:31,000 --> 00:34:32,800
Looking back, that was all evidence.

845
00:34:33,199 --> 00:34:34,760
Was she even making a movie?

846
00:34:35,079 --> 00:34:36,440
Who does she think she is?

847
00:34:36,559 --> 00:34:37,599
A total jinx.

848
00:34:37,880 --> 00:34:39,159
A walking plague.

849
00:34:39,159 --> 00:34:40,559
People die as soon as she's back.

850
00:34:41,119 --> 00:34:41,599
Disgusting.

851
00:34:41,599 --> 00:34:42,239
Great, now

852
00:34:42,519 --> 00:34:43,719
she jinxed Ma Guowen to death,

853
00:34:44,039 --> 00:34:44,920
and didn't even make any money.

854
00:34:46,000 --> 00:34:46,639
All right, I'm heading out.

855
00:34:47,360 --> 00:34:48,480
Aren't you eating with me?

856
00:34:48,480 --> 00:34:49,639
We haven't eaten together in ages.

857
00:34:49,679 --> 00:34:50,480
No time for that.

858
00:34:50,480 --> 00:34:52,159
Cripple Qian has to go back and guard the gate.

859
00:34:52,239 --> 00:34:53,079
If I'm late,

860
00:34:53,119 --> 00:34:54,639
people will think I skipped town out of guilt.

861
00:34:55,360 --> 00:34:56,320
Are you an idiot?

862
00:34:56,760 --> 00:34:57,599
Not putting on your army coat?

863
00:34:57,639 --> 00:34:58,880
Freeze yourself to death, you old cripple.

864
00:34:59,280 --> 00:34:59,599
Forgot.

865
00:35:00,840 --> 00:35:01,239
Hands out.

866
00:35:01,320 --> 00:35:01,800
Oh, boy.

867
00:35:04,280 --> 00:35:04,920
Gloves.

868
00:35:07,440 --> 00:35:08,079
Put them on.

869
00:35:08,119 --> 00:35:08,880
It's freezing out there.

870
00:35:09,800 --> 00:35:10,159
Give me a kiss.

871
00:35:10,239 --> 00:35:10,920
What are you doing?

872
00:35:11,400 --> 00:35:12,559
Come on, just one kiss.

873
00:35:13,480 --> 00:35:14,400
Not in the mood.

874
00:35:15,559 --> 00:35:16,000
Get lost.

875
00:36:26,159 --> 00:36:28,199
My name is Qian Yichuan.

876
00:36:28,239 --> 00:36:30,639
As a college graduate,

877
00:36:31,679 --> 00:36:33,719
I hope to use what I've learned

878
00:36:34,639 --> 00:36:36,559
to serve our country's brewing industry

879
00:36:36,840 --> 00:36:37,800
and make a contribution.

880
00:37:00,079 --> 00:37:01,440
Why isn't anyone worried?

881
00:37:02,119 --> 00:37:02,880
Go ask around.

882
00:37:03,559 --> 00:37:04,400
20,000 or 30,000 yuan,

883
00:37:04,440 --> 00:37:05,880
what does a severance buyout even mean?

884
00:37:06,039 --> 00:37:06,920
Will that last till you die?

885
00:37:08,000 --> 00:37:09,119
We only have two options.

886
00:37:09,679 --> 00:37:10,239
First,

887
00:37:10,559 --> 00:37:11,639
we get laid off and get the hell home.

888
00:37:11,960 --> 00:37:12,480
Second,

889
00:37:13,039 --> 00:37:14,519
we beat Ma Guowen to it

890
00:37:14,519 --> 00:37:15,360
and buy the factory ourselves.

891
00:37:16,519 --> 00:37:17,519
Just the few of us?

892
00:37:17,639 --> 00:37:18,239
We pool our money!

893
00:37:18,239 --> 00:37:19,360
Figure something out! If we aren't enough,

894
00:37:19,360 --> 00:37:20,440
what about the people around us?

895
00:37:20,480 --> 00:37:20,960
People we can trust!

896
00:37:20,960 --> 00:37:21,880
A single spark can start a prairie fire!

897
00:37:22,079 --> 00:37:22,800
What else is there to say?

898
00:37:22,840 --> 00:37:23,320
Get out!

899
00:37:25,159 --> 00:37:25,920
Let me tell you.

900
00:37:26,880 --> 00:37:27,639
Just now...

901
00:37:27,679 --> 00:37:28,480
When you were in your meeting earlier,

902
00:37:28,480 --> 00:37:29,159
she recorded the whole thing!

903
00:37:29,320 --> 00:37:29,719
What's going on?

904
00:37:29,800 --> 00:37:31,400
Wh-What did you record this for?

905
00:37:31,679 --> 00:37:32,639
Wh-Who sent you here?

906
00:37:33,840 --> 00:37:34,400
Spit it out!

907
00:37:36,639 --> 00:37:37,639
Did Ma Guowen send you?

908
00:37:37,800 --> 00:37:38,760
She secretly recorded us!

909
00:37:38,760 --> 00:37:39,280
She recorded us!

910
00:37:39,280 --> 00:37:40,039
She secretly recorded the meeting!

911
00:37:40,280 --> 00:37:41,000
Wait, this...

912
00:37:41,480 --> 00:37:42,400
I-I know about this.

913
00:37:42,440 --> 00:37:43,239
You know?

914
00:37:43,519 --> 00:37:44,400
You filmed from outside?

915
00:37:45,719 --> 00:37:46,480
In this freezing cold?

916
00:37:46,480 --> 00:37:47,400
You should film inside!

917
00:37:47,519 --> 00:37:47,960
Right, you go...

918
00:37:48,079 --> 00:37:49,280
You can't film inside either!

919
00:37:49,840 --> 00:37:51,559
If you knew, why didn't you say so?

920
00:37:51,559 --> 00:37:52,920
You have to explain this to us!

921
00:37:53,679 --> 00:37:55,199
Don't be scared, they won't do anything.

922
00:37:55,320 --> 00:37:56,199
They're just bluffing.

923
00:37:56,199 --> 00:37:56,800
L-Listen to her.

924
00:37:57,280 --> 00:37:59,079
Cold, right? Hold this to warm your hands.

925
00:37:59,239 --> 00:38:00,039
Keep it down.

926
00:38:00,320 --> 00:38:01,079
I had no choice!

927
00:38:01,920 --> 00:38:03,039
Stop talking, someone's coming.

928
00:38:03,159 --> 00:38:03,880
Someone's coming! Someone's coming!

929
00:38:08,519 --> 00:38:09,360
Have you eaten yet?

930
00:38:10,159 --> 00:38:11,480
Come on, let's head inside and crack some melon seeds.

931
00:38:12,360 --> 00:38:12,719
Right.

932
00:38:12,719 --> 00:38:13,760
Go cr-crack some seeds.

933
00:38:14,159 --> 00:38:14,599
Crack melon seeds.

934
00:38:14,599 --> 00:38:15,360
Wait, this...

935
00:38:15,800 --> 00:38:16,280
Xuemei.

936
00:38:16,280 --> 00:38:17,320
Let's go crack some melon seeds.

937
00:38:17,559 --> 00:38:18,280
Go inside.

938
00:38:18,280 --> 00:38:18,920
It's warm.

939
00:38:19,480 --> 00:38:19,880
Thank you.

940
00:38:19,880 --> 00:38:20,440
Go on, go.

941
00:38:21,239 --> 00:38:22,000
Let's go.

942
00:38:22,440 --> 00:38:23,719
You're holding her lunchbox. Take it.

943
00:38:33,599 --> 00:38:35,519
The documentary *The Malt Kingdom* that I shot

944
00:38:35,639 --> 00:38:37,599
was commissioned by the TV station.

945
00:38:38,239 --> 00:38:39,280
That one's already done.

946
00:38:40,320 --> 00:38:41,360
What I'm filming now

947
00:38:41,760 --> 00:38:42,679
wasn't ordered by the station,

948
00:38:43,320 --> 00:38:44,880
and definitely not by Director Ma.

949
00:38:46,320 --> 00:38:47,519
I was simply inspired

950
00:38:47,519 --> 00:38:49,559
by your passion to protect the plant,

951
00:38:50,159 --> 00:38:52,440
and wanted to document the whole thing.

952
00:38:53,239 --> 00:38:54,920
Maybe down the road, it could make a great film

953
00:38:54,920 --> 00:38:57,239
showing your hard work and struggle.

954
00:38:59,639 --> 00:39:01,039
Right now, I'm the one

955
00:39:01,480 --> 00:39:03,320
paying for the tapes and renting gear.

956
00:39:03,800 --> 00:39:04,880
I didn't take a dime from the factory,

957
00:39:05,239 --> 00:39:05,960
or the TV station,

958
00:39:06,400 --> 00:39:08,360
and certainly not from Ma Guowen.

959
00:39:09,880 --> 00:39:10,639
So,

960
00:39:10,840 --> 00:39:12,159
I will never sell you out.

961
00:39:13,000 --> 00:39:14,480
I'm standing with you.

962
00:39:19,880 --> 00:39:20,760
Understand?

963
00:39:21,559 --> 00:39:22,199
Believe her now?

964
00:39:23,480 --> 00:39:24,440
Puts your minds at ease, right?

965
00:39:25,400 --> 00:39:27,800
Reporter Shen is paying out of her own pocket

966
00:39:28,199 --> 00:39:29,920
to film our struggle

967
00:39:30,280 --> 00:39:32,920
against Ma Guowen and his crew,

968
00:39:33,000 --> 00:39:33,639
right?

969
00:39:34,519 --> 00:39:35,360
And when the time comes,

970
00:39:35,599 --> 00:39:36,360
once we get old,

971
00:39:36,960 --> 00:39:39,440
we can show this footage to our kids

972
00:39:39,440 --> 00:39:40,519
and grandkids!

973
00:39:40,960 --> 00:39:41,840
Let them see

974
00:39:41,960 --> 00:39:44,679
how badass their grandparents were!

975
00:39:44,679 --> 00:39:45,199
Right?

976
00:39:45,719 --> 00:39:47,400
What are you all panicking for?

977
00:39:47,840 --> 00:39:49,039
Don't be so silly!

978
00:39:49,840 --> 00:39:50,800
Haipeng, knock it off.

979
00:39:51,480 --> 00:39:52,119
I disagree—

980
00:39:53,480 --> 00:39:57,039
unless you give Chunyan and me more screen time!

981
00:39:57,079 --> 00:39:57,440
Oh, brother!

982
00:39:57,480 --> 00:39:59,519
I'll burn it onto a disc for my kids.

983
00:40:00,840 --> 00:40:01,960
I think that's pretty great.

984
00:40:01,960 --> 00:40:02,639
Come to think of it,

985
00:40:02,800 --> 00:40:04,840
if our plant ever opens a museum,

986
00:40:05,039 --> 00:40:06,679
this could be valuable history.

987
00:40:07,280 --> 00:40:07,960
It's a good thing.

988
00:40:08,239 --> 00:40:08,679
Yeah.

989
00:40:08,880 --> 00:40:09,559
Go ahead and film! Film away!

990
00:40:10,039 --> 00:40:10,519
We'll be part of—

991
00:40:10,519 --> 00:40:11,440
"Plant history"? You sure dream big.

992
00:40:13,000 --> 00:40:13,559
Haipeng.

993
00:40:14,559 --> 00:40:15,000
Sit down.

994
00:40:16,039 --> 00:40:16,639
Sit down.

995
00:40:19,000 --> 00:40:19,639
What's this?

996
00:40:24,079 --> 00:40:24,840
Around here,

997
00:40:25,079 --> 00:40:25,719
we have a rule.

998
00:40:26,599 --> 00:40:27,760
If you want to join us,

999
00:40:30,039 --> 00:40:30,519
chug it!

1000
00:40:30,800 --> 00:40:31,360
Cut it out!

1001
00:40:31,360 --> 00:40:32,039
He's right!

1002
00:40:32,199 --> 00:40:32,800
A pledge of loyalty!

1003
00:40:32,800 --> 00:40:33,880
She doesn't know how to drink.

1004
00:40:34,119 --> 00:40:34,880
I'll drink it for her.

1005
00:40:39,000 --> 00:40:39,880
Fine.

1006
00:40:40,000 --> 00:40:41,280
All right, all right.

1007
00:40:41,280 --> 00:40:42,280
Give it to me, hand it over.

1008
00:40:42,320 --> 00:40:43,000
That's enough.

1009
00:40:43,159 --> 00:40:44,280
I'll chug the rest,

1010
00:40:44,519 --> 00:40:44,960
all right?

1011
00:40:44,960 --> 00:40:45,360
Deal.

1012
00:40:45,840 --> 00:40:46,760
Cut it out, will you?

1013
00:40:47,239 --> 00:40:48,239
Drinking on the job

1014
00:40:48,800 --> 00:40:49,559
is forbidden!

1015
00:40:52,559 --> 00:40:53,400
Why not?

1016
00:40:53,719 --> 00:40:54,519
Come on, dock his pay!

1017
00:40:54,760 --> 00:40:55,199
Never mind that.

1018
00:40:55,679 --> 00:40:56,519
Go on, keep filming.

1019
00:40:56,519 --> 00:40:56,880
Right, right.

1020
00:40:57,440 --> 00:40:58,239
Are we gonna talk business or what?

1021
00:40:58,719 --> 00:40:58,920
Come on.

1022
00:40:58,960 --> 00:40:59,639
Just now,

1023
00:40:59,920 --> 00:41:00,480
I was just...

1024
00:41:00,519 --> 00:41:01,320
Before you got here,

1025
00:41:01,360 --> 00:41:02,360
we were in the washroom...

1026
00:41:11,840 --> 00:41:13,320
Don't be nervous. Relax.

1027
00:41:13,800 --> 00:41:15,280
Yeah, don't be nervous.

1028
00:41:15,599 --> 00:41:16,440
No, I mean...

1029
00:41:16,559 --> 00:41:17,360
Go ahead, speak.

1030
00:41:17,840 --> 00:41:18,840
She's filming right now.

1031
00:41:18,840 --> 00:41:19,840
How are we supposed to scheme?

1032
00:41:20,239 --> 00:41:20,960
Exactly.

1033
00:41:24,199 --> 00:41:25,920
We're all in this together now.

1034
00:41:25,960 --> 00:41:27,320
It's not scheming if we're on the same side.

1035
00:41:27,719 --> 00:41:28,519
Right, right, right.

1036
00:41:28,559 --> 00:41:29,360
It's not scheming. Come on, come on.

1037
00:41:29,360 --> 00:41:29,719
Right.

1038
00:41:29,719 --> 00:41:30,599
Relax, relax.

1039
00:41:30,719 --> 00:41:31,039
Come on.

1040
00:41:31,679 --> 00:41:32,000
Go ahead and speak.

1041
00:41:32,880 --> 00:41:33,440
Speak up.

1042
00:41:34,639 --> 00:41:35,159
Say what?

1043
00:41:37,360 --> 00:41:38,480
Say whatever you want.

1044
00:41:39,159 --> 00:41:39,920
Just pretend I'm not here.

1045
00:41:40,639 --> 00:41:41,079
Okay.

1046
00:41:41,079 --> 00:41:41,599
Go on, speak.

1047
00:41:42,760 --> 00:41:43,920
It's about time.

1048
00:41:44,360 --> 00:41:47,000
Since Reporter Shen is here,

1049
00:41:47,280 --> 00:41:48,880
let's take a group photo of us shareholders.

1050
00:41:49,719 --> 00:41:50,800
Sure, sure. A photo!

1051
00:41:51,119 --> 00:41:51,639
A group photo.

1052
00:41:51,639 --> 00:41:52,239
Take a picture.

1053
00:41:52,320 --> 00:41:53,159
Yeah, let's take a picture.

1054
00:41:53,280 --> 00:41:54,400
Let's get a photo then.

1055
00:41:55,000 --> 00:41:55,400
Come on.

1056
00:41:56,639 --> 00:41:57,400
Come on, Xuemei.

1057
00:41:57,519 --> 00:41:58,000
Squeeze in.

1058
00:41:58,000 --> 00:41:58,400
Oh, gosh.

1059
00:41:59,400 --> 00:41:59,840
Come on.

1060
00:42:00,559 --> 00:42:01,119
Get in position.

1061
00:42:07,639 --> 00:42:08,519
Relax.

1062
00:42:08,920 --> 00:42:09,760
Right, relax.

1063
00:42:10,480 --> 00:42:11,719
Okay, listen to me.

1064
00:42:12,000 --> 00:42:12,880
Say "Lapi"!

1065
00:42:12,880 --> 00:42:13,480
Lapi!

1066
00:42:13,480 --> 00:42:14,360
Keep it down.

1067
00:42:16,199 --> 00:42:18,079
Ready, one, two, three.

1068
00:42:18,559 --> 00:42:20,480
Lapi!

1069
00:42:24,559 --> 00:42:25,880
Smile a bit, smile a bit.

1070
00:42:26,079 --> 00:42:26,639
Right, right, right.

1071
00:42:26,639 --> 00:42:27,079
You guys...

1072
00:42:27,199 --> 00:42:28,159
Honestly, you're way too tense.

1073
00:42:28,360 --> 00:42:29,320
Act natural.

1074
00:42:29,480 --> 00:42:30,039
Listen to me again.

1075
00:42:30,119 --> 00:42:31,000
Follow my lead again.

1076
00:42:31,320 --> 00:42:32,079
Get ready.

1077
00:42:34,280 --> 00:42:37,320
Lapi is our home,

1078
00:42:37,760 --> 00:42:40,800
and we all love it!

1079
00:42:41,079 --> 00:42:41,679
Yeah!

1080
00:43:34,079 --> 00:43:35,960
Who killed Ma Guowen?

1081
00:43:36,119 --> 00:43:36,920
You did.

1082
00:43:39,320 --> 00:43:40,239
I should've just...

1083
00:43:40,320 --> 00:43:41,119
killed him.

1084
00:43:41,880 --> 00:43:42,320
Right.

1085
00:43:42,800 --> 00:43:44,119
So does the killer

1086
00:43:44,280 --> 00:43:45,360
have any connection

1087
00:43:46,239 --> 00:43:47,679
to the person who filmed it?

1088
00:43:48,440 --> 00:43:49,440
Wasn't the person filming

1089
00:43:50,400 --> 00:43:51,400
Shen Leshui?

1090
00:43:53,880 --> 00:43:55,880
Lately, whenever I see black trash bags like this,

1091
00:43:55,880 --> 00:43:56,760
I get on edge.

1092
00:43:57,360 --> 00:43:58,000
What's in here?

1093
00:43:58,000 --> 00:43:58,800
Can I take a look?

1094
00:44:01,719 --> 00:44:02,280
Who is it?
